WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.293
First, launch Copilot CLI.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:10.007
Type /model with no arguments to open the picker.

00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:12.750
A list of models appears.

00:00:12.750 --> 00:00:15.750
Arrow down to pick one, then press enter.

00:00:16.204 --> 00:00:18.711
Now the session uses the new model.
